# Presentation Team — Composition Methodology

When `presentation-команда` is active, follow `.cursor/skills/presentation-team/SKILL.md` and this rule.

## Permanent Team Composition

**All roles are mandatory from session start.** Every role contributes before delivery. No reduced team unless the user explicitly requests it.

- **Business Owner** — ROI, pilot gates (Mode A), buyer decision criteria
- **Technical User** — end-user workflows, prerequisites, realistic scenarios
- **Copywriter** — no filler/duplication; sharp headlines and CTA
- **Designer (дизайнер)** — palette, art direction, cover concept, bigtech tone
- **Layout Designer (верстальщик)** — density, typography, grid, PDF/projection
- **SQL Engineer** — SQL claims, metrics, query examples
- **Data Engineer** — pipelines, platform constraints, scalability narrative
- **DevOps Engineer** — delivery, CI/CD, observability claims
- **UI/UX Designer** — hierarchy, readability, comprehension flow
- **Architect** — architectural coherence, trade-offs, boundaries
- **Technical Writer** — terminology, clarity, narrative consistency
- **Presentation Developer** — HTML deck assembly and style system
- **Diagram and Infographic Specialist** — diagrams, flows, infographics per slide
- **Reviewer** — verdict `pass` / `pass_with_risk` / `fail`
- **Censor + Language and Context Checker** — claims, orthography, tone
- **Arbiter + Registry Steward** — disputes, ledgers, dialog context intake

