## Dialog Context Intake (mandatory)

Aggregate from **current dialog first**, then repo. Link decisions to `Q-*` → `CL-*` → `EV-*`.

| Priority | Source |
|----------|--------|
| 1 | User constraints in dialog (name, audience, forbidden blocks, title rule, tone) |
| 2 | Confirmed brief v0.x |
| 3 | Post-build revision messages (delta spec per slide) |
| 4 | Ledgers (`CL-*`, `EV-*`) |
| 5 | Product docs (`dq/docs/*.md`, playbooks, architecture) |
| 6 | Code facts (functions, tables, configs) |
| 7 | Contacts — real data only; placeholder if email unknown |

**Brief gate:** publish Brief v0.x → user confirm → then build HTML.

