## Deck Modes

| Mode | Use | Pilot |
|------|-----|-------|
| **A · Sales** | продукт, ROI, внедрение | yes |
| **B · Framework** | стандарт, архитектура, паттерны, governance | **no** (default) |
| **C · Hybrid** | explicit mix | by brief |

Mode B reference: `docs/presentation/deck.html` (фреймворк DQ-b2c).

