## Slide Maps

### Mode A · Sales (~11 slides)

Title (value + pills) → Problem → Economics → Solution → Roles → Architecture → Demo → Positioning → Roadmap → Pilot/KPI → CTA.

### Mode B · Framework (~12 slides)

| # | Slide |
|---|--------|
| 1 | **Title only** — no pills/hero on cover |
| 2 | Overview — lead, tags, 3 feature cards |
| 3 | Why standard — method-cycle + layer-stack |
| 4 | Architecture — arch-flow + table |
| 5 | Pattern catalog |
| 6 | Interface + registration |
| 7 | Design rationale — pillars |
| 8 | Trade-offs — plus/minus |
| 9 | Scale + resilience — change matrix |
| 10 | Governance + business value |
| 11 | Application scope — **no doc file list** |
| 12 | Contacts — **no repo/docs** unless user asks |

---

## Content Aggregation Pipeline

```text
Intake → Brief → Confirm → Slide map → Content blocks → Infographics → HTML → QA → PDF → User delta → Re-export
```

**Per-slide block:** purpose, headline, lead, primary_visual, evidence, roles_hook.

