## Anti-patterns

- Emoji / messenger pictograms
- Fake percentage meters
- Summary repeating title metrics
- Doc bibliography on Mode B closing slide
- Repo paths on contacts when user excluded them
- Meta commentary in titles
- Strict corporate dull palette when bigtech casual fits audience
